 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "TaskManager() starts empty; every call carries a timestamp and timestamps strictly increase. addTask(timestamp, name, priority) stores a task and returns its id \"taskId<n>\" with n = 1, 2, ... in creation order (duplicates allowed). updateTask(timestamp, taskId, name, priority) replaces both fields and returns true, or returns false for an unknown id. getTask(timestamp, taskId) returns \"<name>(<priority>)\", or \"\" for an unknown id. searchTasks(timestamp, nameFilter, maxResults) returns the ids of tasks whose current name contains nameFilter (case-sensitive substring), ordered by priority descending and then creation order, at most maxResults of them. listTasksSorted(timestamp, limit) returns the first limit ids of all tasks in the same order.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk10-b-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
